{"id":777020,"title":"04｜文本的力量：打造高效Prompt","content":"本节课主要教授如何编写高效的AI图像生成提示词。首先介绍了prompt在AI图像生成中的核心作用，通过不断细化关键词来调整生成图像的效果。接着详细讲解了四种编写有效prompt的方法：一是按照产品文本模板编写定制的prompt，包括主题、环境氛围、构图和风格等；二是借助外部词库网站查找和借鉴他人的提示词；三是利用ChatGPT分析图片并生成提示词；四是结合多种方法整合出最合适的提示词。课程还演示了如何使用这些方法生成具体的图像，并强调了多次尝试和调整的重要性。最后，鼓励学员利用所学技巧进行创意实践。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":392634,"user_name":"A子紫","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":3928166,"ip_address":"上海","ucode":"15080394285580","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/3b/f0/66/2b76d8a8.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1721369090,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100767501,"comment_content":"风格什么的关键词在哪里看呢？","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1072798,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/10/5e/9e/43a604b1.jpg","nickname":"Mttao","note":"","ucode":"7BFC712BBD405D","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":true},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":650248,"discussion_content":"课件下载链接：链接: https://pan.baidu.com/s/1W_EVngO7UTys082ttWe5gA 提取码: w2i1","content_length":68,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1724651858,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"广东","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]}]}